\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2.3}{\ignorespaces Summary of different SM signal models. The MC samples are from full Run 2 yearly productions (2016, 2017 and 2018) assuming $m_{\rm H} = 125.0\GeV $. The fiducial acceptance ($\mathcal {A}_{\rm fid}$) defined the fraction of events passing fiducial phase space selections, reconstruction efficiency ($\epsilon $) represented by the ratio of reconstructed to accepted events. Also, $f_{\rm nonfid}$ which are reconstructed events but does not pass fiducial phase space definition at generator level. Values are obtained using 13~TeV signal models and the uncertainties shown are only statistical uncertainties. \relax }}{13}{table.caption.31}
